================================================================================
RUNTIME DEPENDENCIES
================================================================================

Quorumloop depends on third-party npm packages (NestJS, Fastify, Drizzle ORM,
postgres.js, NATS client, zod, pino, React, Vite, and others). Their licenses are
declared in the lockfile and in each package's own manifest; `pnpm licenses list`
produces the full inventory for a given install. Dependencies are audited in CI,
and no dependency is added without a stated reason in the pull request that
introduces it.
